WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.063
This query trims name boundaries collapses repeated
whitespace and applies title-style capitalization

00:00:07.911 --> 00:00:13.470
Run it and compare raw and cleaned names The goal is
to create a more

00:00:13.483 --> 00:00:19.584
consistent analytical representation In production
name capitalization

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:24.939
can be domain-sensitive so treat INITCAP as a
teaching convenience rather than a universal truth
